<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - First Boston on oil cos.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - First Boston on oil cos.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Boston said it upgraded British Petroleum Co Plc to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- said downgraded Royal Dutch Petroleum Co and Shell Transport and Trading Co Plc to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
